{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19106140","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19106140","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:5:1910613001:0":{"text":"He's back... He's back...","source_cn":"回来了，回来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B941D65B5D2DE6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910613002:0":{"text":"Together... together...","source_cn":"一起一起一起起起……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B3BA0A3C8BE3233","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910614001:1":{"text":"Hey, Tentacle Guy. Who the heck are these ugly varmints?","source_cn":"触手男，这恶心的怪物是什么啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB659540068E3033E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910614002:1":{"text":"Mister Calix, they are...?","source_cn":"卡律先生，它们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE22FB78A77E00E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910614003:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">They're my family...</style> or they used to be.","source_cn":"……<style=highlight2>是我的家人</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE2C43872FE056A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1910614003":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">They're my family...</style> or they used to be.","source_cn":"……<style=highlight2>是我的家人</style>。曾经是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE2C43872FE056A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910614004:1":{"text":"They're your family? But they look so... uh... should we greet them?","source_cn":"他们、他们是你的家人？但是，但是他们的模样……呃，我是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6387DD88107A04FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910614005:1":{"text":"Hello everyone...","source_cn":"你们……好……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A7B405F54236D1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910614006:1":{"text":"Stand back and don't get near them.","source_cn":"退后，不要靠近。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x005608004A469BD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910614007:1":{"text":"他们是深岩家族最后的样子。","source_cn":"他们是深岩家族最后的样子。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xB61E9965DAA4760B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910614008:1":{"text":"They've already caught the scent of the Shallowfolk and the flesh of their own kin. The hunt will begin at any moment.","source_cn":"他们已经嗅到了浅海裔的气息和同族的血肉，捕食马上就会开始。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE99AB79D0567F2B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910614009:1":{"text":"You all should leave. This is a clan matter. I'll handle it myself.","source_cn":"你们离开，这是我家的事，我自己处理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5278CA8FA93F367D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910614010:1":{"text":"What do you mean \"hunt\"? What the heck are you talking about?","source_cn":"什么捕食，触手男，你在说什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F3360F86E27D9E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910614011:1":{"text":"You, me, all of us! If we don't act now, in the next heartbeat, we'll be torn to shreds!","source_cn":"你，我，我们！如果不动手，下一瞬就会变成他们腕足间的碎肉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C0128A5EEDB930F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910614012:1":{"text":"Then what are we waiting for?!","source_cn":"那还等什么？咱——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E7534EDCA46429B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910614013:1":{"text":"I said step back!","source_cn":"——都退后！我说了，退后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FBEAB07AAF17DE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910614014:1":{"text":"这是深岩家的事，我的血亲，我自己处理。","source_cn":"这是深岩家的事，我的血亲，我自己处理。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xDB6B54BFE60498E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1910614014":{"text":"这是深岩家的事，我的血亲，我自己处理。","source_cn":"这是深岩家的事，我的血亲，我自己处理。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xDB6B54BFE60498E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910614015:1":{"text":"What?! No, Mister Calix!","source_cn":"什么？！不，卡律先生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BA70E3BF04CB9C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910614016:1":{"text":"If anyone else touches them, I'll tear that person to pieces!","source_cn":"谁敢碰他们，我就把谁撕碎！！我会把那个人的内脏全部扯出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA61B5DF9CE8F0CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910614017:1":{"text":"If you understand, then go! The farther the better!","source_cn":"如果你们听懂了，就走，走得越远越好！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x588BCA24CC48EB8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1910614017":{"text":"If you understand, then go! The farther the better!","source_cn":"如果你们听懂了，就走，走得越远越好！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x588BCA24CC48EB8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910614018:1":{"text":"... Alright, let's go. Tolan, don't bother Mister Calix. Those are his family. I-I understand how he feels...","source_cn":"……好，我们走！图澜，不要打扰卡律先生了，那是他的亲族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD67DA49975768CEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910614019:1":{"text":"Fine, whatever. Hey, Tentacle Guy! Don't go dying here!","source_cn":"啧！成，咱走。但是触手男，你不许死在这儿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x651D681A01297530","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:31:1910614020:1":{"text":"You all turn and leave. As you leave, you hear those creatures let out strange hisses from their throats.","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x10EF867F454AF873","variant_status":"runtime_gender_ke